      "writtenOn": "2021-11-11T17:50:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We also need to call updateReportingCriteria, very similar case as EVENT_SET_SIGNAL_STRENGTH_UPDATE_REQUEST.\n\nThe case is that, client (e.g. Bluetooth) may have set the SignalStrengthUpdate request to continue reporting signal when device is idle. The idle state change event is the moment we need to re-evalute the client + system signal strength criteria. Although system\u0027s part did not change, the clients\u0027 part (cached in mSignalRequestRecords) need to double-check here.",
